// A 0.96 inch 128 x 64 monochrome OLED panel with its SSD1306 controller on the glass, the
// UG-2864HSWEG01 class the common I2C modules carry. The pins are FPC pins from section 1.5 of
// the panel sheet: 1 and 30 are N.C.(GND) and 29 is VLSS, which section 1.5 ties to ground, so
// they join VSS on 8. 19 and 20 are D1 and D2, which I2C joins as SDA. The model is the engine's
// ssd1306 on I2C.
{
  "format": 6, "part": "ssd1306-oled-128x64", "version": "0.1.1", "title": "OLED panel, 0.96 inch 128 x 64, SSD1306", "license": "MIT OR Apache-2.0",
  "summary": "0.96 inch 128 x 64 white OLED panel with an SSD1306 controller on the glass and a 30-pin FPC, wired for I2C at address 0x3C.",
  "tags": ["oled", "display", "screen", "ssd1306", "128x64", "i2c"],
  "docs": {
